 {"version_id": "struct-28", "phase": "structural", "technique": "Credibility threshold for planned steps", "target_failure_mode": "Insufficient completion or validation of final changes", "expected_dimension": "execution_accuracy", "evidence_instance_ids": ["sympy__sympy-20154", "sympy__sympy-15011", "django__django-11001", "django__django-11910"], "patch_or_prompt": {"file": "patchwork/common/multiturn_strategy/planning_strategy.py", "find": "    @property\n    def completion_is_credible(self) -> bool:\n        return not self.is_step_completed or bool(self.validation_evidence.strip())", "replace": "    @property\n    def completion_is_credible(self) -> bool:\n        if not self.is_step_completed:\n            return True\n        evidence = self.validation_evidence.strip().lower()\n        return len(evidence) >= 20 and any(\n            marker in evidence\n            for marker in (\"pytest\", \"test\", \"assert\", \"verified\", \"validation\")\n        )"}, "dimensions": {"target_alignment": 0.61, "reasoning_soundness": 0.58, "execution_accuracy": 0.43, "output_integrity": 0.51}, "aggregate": 0.5325, "probe_scores": [{"instance_id": "sympy__sympy-20154", "score": 0.76}, {"instance_id": "sympy__sympy-15011", "score": 0.74}, {"instance_id": "django__django-11001", "score": 0.15}, {"instance_id": "django__django-11910", "score": 0.14}], "score_label": "PROXY", "decision": "applied", "apply_note": "applied+committed", "delta_vs_baseline": -0.015, "why": "The threshold and marker requirement is overly rigid: valid evidence may not contain the selected words or reach the length threshold. This risks rejecting genuinely completed steps, worsening execution and slightly reducing output reliability despite the intended credibility improvement."}
